msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>P</keycap> </shortcut> <guimenu>खेल</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>विरामं कुरुत</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:330
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pauses or resumes the game."
msgstr "क्रीडां विरामयति पुनः आरभते वा।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:335
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show High "
"Scores</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>उच्चाङ्कान् "
"दर्शयतु</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:343
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens a dialog that displays different high score tables."
msgstr "एकं संवादं उद्घाटयति यत् भिन्नानि उच्चाङ्कसारणीनि प्रदर्शयति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:350
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>प्रश्न</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>निवृत्तं</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:358
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Quit</action> and close &kbounce;. If a game is currently played, "
"it's status is lost."
msgstr ""
"<action>Quit</action> तथा &kbounce;. यदि सम्प्रति कश्चन क्रीडा क्रीड्यते "
"तर्हि तस्य स्थितिः नष्टा भवति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:366
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Settings Menu"
msgstr "सेटिंग्स् मेन्यू इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:371
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Play Sounds</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>ध्वनयः वादयन्तु</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:376
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "If checked, &kbounce; game sounds are played."
msgstr "यदि परीक्षितं तर्हि &kbounce; क्रीडाध्वनयः वाद्यन्ते।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:381
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Difficulty</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guisubmenu>कठिनता</guisubmenu>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:386
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select a game difficulty. On higher difficulty levels the walls are build "
"slower while balls move faster. That makes it harder to fence an area in "
"the board."
msgstr ""
"एकं क्रीडा कठिनतां चिनुत। उच्चतरकठिनतास्तरयोः भित्तिः मन्दतरं निर्मितं "
"भवति, कन्दुकाः तु द्रुततरं गच्छन्ति । तस्मात् फलकस्य क्षेत्रस्य वेष्टनं "
"कठिनं भवति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:393
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kbounce; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">Settings Menu</ulink> "
"and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"अतिरिक्तरूपेण &kbounce; सामान्यं &kde; <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> तथा "
"<guimenu>सहायता</guimenu> मेनू-वस्तूनाम्, अधिकसूचनार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">सेटिंग्स् मेन्यू< "
"इत्यस्य विषये विभागान् पठन्तु /ulink> तथा च &kde; मौलिकता।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:404
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "बहुधा पृष्टाः प्रश्नाः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:409
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "अहम् अस्य क्रीडायाः स्वरूपं परिवर्तयितुम् इच्छामि। अहं शक्नोमि ?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:410
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To change &kbounce; visual theme you can use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"&kbounce;…</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option on the menubar."
msgstr ""
"आम्‌। परिवर्तनार्थं &kbounce; दृश्यविषयं भवन्तः मेनूपट्टिकायां "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu><guimenuitem>विन्यस्तं कुर्वन्तु "
"&kbounce;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> विकल्पस्य उपयोगं कर्तुं शक्नुवन्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:413
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr "मया त्रुटिः कृता। अहं पूर्ववत् कर्तुं शक्नोमि वा ?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:414
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kbounce; does not have an <quote>Undo</quote> feature."
msgstr "&kbounce; <quote>Undo</quote> इति विशेषता नास्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:417
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play this game?"
msgstr "एतत् क्रीडां कर्तुं कीबोर्डस्य उपयोगं कर्तुं शक्नोमि वा?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:418
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kbounce; cannot be played using keyboard."
msgstr "न &kbounce; कीबोर्डस्य उपयोगेन वादयितुं न शक्यते।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:421
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"इदानीं मया क्रीडां त्यक्तव्या, परन्तु अहम् अद्यापि न समाप्तः। अहं मम "
"प्रगतिम् रक्षितुं शक्नोमि वा ?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:422
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kbounce; does not have a <quote>Save</quote> feature at the moment."
msgstr "&kbounce; अस्मिन् क्षणे <quote>रक्षतु</quote> इति विशेषता नास्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:427
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "खेल विन्यास"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:428
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kbounce; configuration dialog allows you to select visual themes for "
"&kbounce;."
msgstr ""
"इति &kbounce; विन्याससंवादः &kbounce; कृते दृश्यविषयान् चयनं कर्तुं शक्नोति "
"।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:429
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select a new theme simply choose the theme from the selection list. Each "
"item in the list shows a small preview left to the theme name. A selection "
"is immediately applied."
msgstr ""
"नूतनं विषयं चयनं कर्तुं केवलं चयनसूचिकातः विषयं चिनोतु । सूचीस्थं प्रत्येकं "
"द्रव्यं विषयनामस्य अवशिष्टं लघु पूर्वावलोकनं दर्शयति । तत्क्षणमेव चयनं "
"प्रयुक्तं भवति।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:434
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select random background pictures from a user defined folder with "
"images."
msgstr ""
"भवान् चित्रैः सह उपयोक्तृनिर्धारितपुटतः यादृच्छिकपृष्ठभूमिचित्रं चिन्वितुं "
"शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:437
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you are satisfied with the theme you have selected you can click the "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> button, located at the bottom part of this dialog."
msgstr ""
"एकदा भवान् भवता चयनितविषयेण सन्तुष्टः अभवत् तदा भवान् "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> इति बटन् नुदतु, यत् अस्य संवादस्य अधः भागे "
"स्थितम् अस्ति ।"

